msgid "SDK 与用户态移植"
msgstr "SDK and userspace porting"

msgid "消费 SDK"
msgstr "Using the SDK"

msgid ""
"SDK 为可重定位 musl sysroot，C 驱动 ``reliefos-musl-cc`` 按自身位置找头与库。 验证时必须真正编译、链接和运行适当探针，覆盖带空格的重定位路径、动态与 "
"``-static``；成功列出归档成员不能替代消费验证。 公开头通过白名单导出，不复制内核私有头。"
msgstr ""
"The SDK is a relocatable musl sysroot. The C driver ``reliefos-musl-cc`` locates headers and "
"libraries relative to itself. Validation must actually compile, link, and run appropriate probes, "
"covering relocation paths containing spaces, dynamic linking, and ``-static``. Successfully "
"listing archive members is no substitute for consumer validation. Public headers are exported "
"through an allowlist; private kernel headers are not copied."

msgid "库与 ABI"
msgstr "Libraries and ABI"

msgid ""
"目标环境使用 musl、mimalloc 和 ReliefOS 扩展库。保持实际 SONAME 与动态 装载依赖，不用宿主 glibc 库冒充目标产物。旧库与旧转发头的兼容范围见 "
":doc:`../userspace-api/abi`。新接口需同步公开头、运行库、内核实现、消费者、 头导出及包归属，不能只改声明。"
msgstr ""
"The target environment uses musl, mimalloc, and ReliefOS extension libraries. Preserve actual "
"SONAMEs and dynamic loading dependencies; do not pass off host glibc libraries as target "
"artifacts. For compatibility with old libraries and forwarding headers, see :doc:`../userspace-"
"api/abi`. New interfaces require coordinated changes to public headers, runtime libraries, kernel "
"implementations, consumers, header exports, and package ownership; declarations alone are "
"insufficient."

msgid ""
"SDK 同时携带锁定版本的 zlib、libpng、SQLite、mbedTLS 3 头文件、动态库和静态库。 驱动为扩展库补全 PNG、zlib、mbedTLS 的传递链接依赖；直接使用 "
"SQLite 的程序 仍需传入 ``-lsqlite3``。开发包的来源元数据位于 ``share/reliefos/sdk/apk``， 许可位于 ``share/licenses``。所有 "
"mbedTLS 消费者必须使用随包配置头，不能使用 旧私有 ``MBEDTLS_CONFIG_FILE`` 配置改变结构布局。"
msgstr ""
"The SDK also includes pinned versions of zlib, libpng, SQLite, and mbedTLS 3 headers, shared "
"libraries, and static libraries. The driver supplies transitive PNG, zlib, and mbedTLS link "
"dependencies for extension libraries; programs using SQLite directly must still pass "
"``-lsqlite3``. Development package provenance metadata is in ``share/reliefos/sdk/apk`` and "
"licenses in ``share/licenses``. All mbedTLS consumers must use the packaged configuration header; "
"do not alter structure layouts with an old private ``MBEDTLS_CONFIG_FILE`` configuration."
